# KPI card contract (Notification Engine)

Visual reference (read-only, do not merge repos):

`/Users/mohamedaasik/Desktop/Cursor/P2P-main/client/src/components/feature/AnimatedKpiCard.tsx`
Live look: `https://p2p-backend-645830234926.asia-south1.run.app/public/insights`

- `EmbedKpiCard` — white card, left pastel icon, dark value, optional share chip + bar
- `NE_KPI_CARD_MIN_H` — `min-h-[128px] lg:min-h-[148px]`
- Grid: `NE_KPI_GRID_CLASS` / `neKpiBalancedGridClass` — 2-up mobile, **always 4-up on lg/xl**
- Palette: `#2B5AED` `#0084AD` `#22C55E` `#EF4444` `#8B5CF6` `#F97316`

## Rules

- Embed and normal dashboards use the same `EmbedKpiCard` / `NE_KPI_GRID_CLASS`.
- **Always 4-up on xl.** Never `md:grid-cols-3` for 3 or 6 cards — that stretches cards too wide.
- Incomplete last rows stay quarter-width (empty cells OK). Do not grow remaining cards to fill the row.
- Same height and width for every card in the grid.
- UI/theme only — do not change scheduled-email KPI logic, click/filter handlers, or incremental sync.
- No P2P click FX (tilt, confetti, delayed onClick, count-up). Share bar is display-only from existing values.
